ubmission.csv SHA-256: {SUB_SHA}\")\n","print(\"submission.csv = the rebuilt 0.95388 file\" if N_STEPS == 0 else \"submission.csv = the 0.95388 file plus the step(s) above\")\n","pd.read_csv(WORK / \"submission.csv\").head()"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"d90579e4","metadata":{"papermill":{"duration":0.035634,"end_time":"2026-11-14T10:32:10.26894+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-11-14T10:32:10.233306+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"source":["<div style=\"background: #eefaf4; border-left: 5px solid #1baf7a; padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 6px; margin: 6px 0;\">\n","<b>Why \"no step\" is a useful result.</b> Searched on all five folds at once, the best of 152 candidate steps looks like a\n","gain of a few points: exactly the kind of number a ladder rung is made of. Chosen honestly, inside the folds, the same\n","search does not gain on enough held-out folds. The members tested here are good models, but the 0.95388 file already\n","contains the information they carry. The next real gain is a member with errors that nobody in the mix shares,\n","checked on OOF first &mdash; the conclusion the ladder authors themselves reach.\n","</div>"]}],"metadata":{"kaggle":{"accelerator":"none","dataSources":[{"sourceType":"competition","sourceId":125225},{"sourceType":"datasetVersion","sourceId":21630579},{"sourceType":"datasetVersion","sourceId":21636903},{"sourceType":"datasetVersion","sourceId":21828751},{"sourceType":"datasetVersion","sourceId":21831925},{"sourceType":"datasetVersion","sourceId":21832761},{"sourceType":"datasetVersion","sourceId":21895589},{"sourceType":"datasetVersion","sourceId":21952712},{"sourceType":"datasetVersion","sourceId":22040253},{"sourceType":"datasetVersion","sourceId":22043214},{"sourceType":"datasetVersion","sourceId":22056192}],"isInternetEnabled":false,"language":"python","sourceType":"notebook","isGpuEnabled":false},"kernelspec":{"display_name":"Python 3","language":"python","name":"python3"},"language_info":{"codemir